      "updated": 1785705133764,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6. Kritik Ad\u0131m \u2014 IPv6\u0027y\u0131 WiFi Adapt\u00F6r\u00FCnde Devre D\u0131\u015F\u0131 B\u0131rakma",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "6. Kritik Ad\u0131m \u2014 IPv6\u0027y\u0131 WiFi Adapt\u00F6r\u00FCnde Devre D\u0131\u015F\u0131 B\u0131rakma",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Y_5HwIBt44lSb3LCh-r38",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 255.70501829912007,
      "y": 4888.291375069107,
      "width": 737.6994018554688,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0r",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 795697467,
      "version": 43,
      "versionNonce": 879155035,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785705133764,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Bu, sorunu as\u0131l \u00E7\u00F6zen ad\u0131md\u0131. IPv6 DNS sunucusu (router\u0027\u0131n kendisi) devrede\nkald\u0131\u011F\u0131 i\u00E7in Windows \u00F6nce ona soruyor ve Acrylic\u0027e hi\u00E7 ula\u015Fm\u0131yordu.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Bu, sorunu as\u0131l \u00E7\u00F6zen ad\u0131md\u0131. IPv6 DNS sunucusu (router\u0027\u0131n kendisi) devrede kald\u0131\u011F\u0131 i\u00E7in Windows \u00F6nce ona soruyor ve Acrylic\u0027e hi\u00E7 ula\u015Fm\u0131yordu.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "a0uTlflPiQPHDvr4kDbP_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 255.70501829912007,
      "y": 4983.291375069107,
      "width": 786.5953369140625,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0s",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1367385077,
      "version": 42,
      "versionNonce": 1683251125,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785705132870,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ncpa.cpl \u2192 WiFi \u003E \u00D6zellikler \u003E \u0022Internet Protocol Version 6 (TCP/IPv6)\u0022 i\u015Faretini\nkald\u0131r",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ncpa.cpl \u2192 WiFi \u003E \u00D6zellikler \u003E \u0022Internet Protocol Version 6 (TCP/IPv6)\u0022 i\u015Faretini kald\u0131r",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
